casebook a-46cfr-58_10-15-gas-turbine-draft v1
source "A-46cfr-58.10-15-gas-turbine.txt" dated 2026-10-14 by "drafted by anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5 from the manual; not yet approved"
note "UNAPPROVED DRAFT: written by a language model from A-46cfr-58.10-15-gas-turbine.txt. Every declaration below cites the sentence"
note "it came from. Check each against the manual, add what the manual does not say, then delete"
note "this note to approve. quorum studio will not build a chip image while it is here."

# manual: "Low lubricating oil pressure."
observe low_lube_pressure "lubricating oil pressure is low"

# manual: "A remote, manually operated shutdown device must be provided."
observe manual_shutdown_demand "the remote manual shutdown device has been operated"

# manual: "Excessive gas temperature, measured at the turbine inlet, gas generator, interstage turbine or turbine exhaust."
observe gas_temp_high "gas temperature is excessive at the turbine inlet, gas generator, interstage turbine or turbine exhaust"

# manual: "Excessive lubricating oil temperature."
observe lube_temp_high "lubricating oil temperature is excessive"

# manual: "Excessive speed."
observe speed_high "speed is excessive"

# manual: "Reduced lubricating oil pressure."
observe lube_pressure_reduced "lubricating oil pressure is reduced"

# manual: "Automatic shutdown must occur under the following conditions:"
observe overspeed "turbine overspeed detected"

# manual: "in those cases where suitable antifriction bearings are fitted"
observe antifriction_bearings_fitted "suitable antifriction bearings are fitted"

# manual: "Gas turbine exhausts must not be interconnected with boiler uptakes"
observe exhaust_interconnected "the gas turbine exhaust is interconnected with a boiler uptake"

# manual: "gas turbines used for emergency power and lighting"
observe emergency_power_lighting_turbine "the gas turbine is used for emergency power and lighting"

# manual: "or for emergency propulsion"
observe emergency_propulsion_turbine "the gas turbine is used for emergency propulsion"

# manual: "Dampers or other suitable means must be installed to prevent backflow of boiler exhaust gases through the turbine."
observe backflow_protection_installed "dampers or other suitable means are installed to prevent backflow of boiler exhaust gases through the turbine"

# manual: "Interconnected exhausts must be specifically approved by the Commandant."
observe commandant_approval "the interconnected exhausts have been specifically approved by the Commandant"

# manual: "A gas turbine exhaust on a mobile offshore drilling unit"
observe unit_is_modu "the gas turbine is installed on a mobile offshore drilling unit"

# manual: "must not discharge in a classified location"
observe exhaust_discharges_classified "the gas turbine exhaust discharges in a classified location"

# manual: "A gas turbine air inlet must not be in a classified location."
observe air_inlet_in_classified_location "the gas turbine air inlet is in a classified location"

# manual: "A remote, manually operated shutdown device must be provided."
claim manual_shutdown "operator has demanded shutdown with the remote device" severity 9 needs manual_shutdown_demand

# manual: "Excessive gas temperature, measured at the turbine inlet, gas generator, interstage turbine or turbine exhaust."
claim gas_temp_alarm "excessive gas temperature alarm" severity 5 needs gas_temp_high

# manual: "Excessive lubricating oil temperature."
claim oil_temp_alarm "excessive lubricating oil temperature alarm" severity 4 needs lube_temp_high

# manual: "Excessive speed."
claim speed_alarm "excessive speed alarm" severity 5 needs speed_high

# manual: "Reduced lubricating oil pressure."
claim oil_pressure_alarm "reduced lubricating oil pressure alarm" severity 4 needs lube_pressure_reduced

# manual: "Consideration will be given providing alarm only (without shutdown) in those cases where suitable antifriction bearings are fitted."
excuse antifriction_alarm_only "with suitable antifriction bearings, alarm only without shutdown may be considered for low oil pressure" needs antifriction_bearings_fitted

# manual: "Gas turbine exhausts must not be interconnected with boiler uptakes"
claim improper_exhaust_interconnection "gas turbine exhaust interconnected with boiler uptake, which is not permitted" severity 5 needs exhaust_interconnected

# manual: "except for gas turbines used for emergency power and lighting"
excuse emergency_power_lighting_exception "interconnection is allowed for gas turbines used for emergency power and lighting" needs emergency_power_lighting_turbine

# manual: "or for emergency propulsion"
excuse emergency_propulsion_exception "interconnection is allowed for gas turbines used for emergency propulsion" needs emergency_propulsion_turbine

# manual: "Dampers or other suitable means must be installed to prevent backflow of boiler exhaust gases through the turbine."
claim backflow_unprotected "boiler exhaust gases could flow back through the turbine because no dampers or other suitable means are installed" severity 5 needs exhaust_interconnected

# manual: "A gas turbine exhaust on a mobile offshore drilling unit must not discharge in a classified location."
claim exhaust_in_classified_location "gas turbine exhaust on a mobile offshore drilling unit discharges in a classified location, which is not permitted" severity 5 needs unit_is_modu exhaust_discharges_classified

# manual: "A gas turbine air inlet must not be in a classified location."
claim air_inlet_classified_location_fault "gas turbine air inlet is in a classified location, which is not permitted" severity 5 needs air_inlet_in_classified_location

# manual: "Low lubricating oil pressure."
claim low_oil_pressure_fault "low lubricating oil pressure requiring automatic shutdown" severity 8 needs low_lube_pressure

# manual: "Low lubricating oil pressure. Consideration will be given providing alarm only (without shutdown) in those cases where suitable antifriction bearings are fitted."
claim low_oil_pressure_alarm_only "low lubricating oil pressure with suitable antifriction bearings fitted: alarm only, without shutdown" severity 4 needs low_lube_pressure antifriction_bearings_fitted

# manual: "Automatic shutdown must occur under the following conditions: (i) Overspeed."
claim overspeed_fault "turbine overspeed requiring automatic shutdown" severity 9 needs overspeed

# manual: "Consideration will be given providing alarm only (without shutdown) in those cases where suitable antifriction bearings are fitted."
antifriction_alarm_only undercuts low_oil_pressure_fault

# manual: "except for gas turbines used for emergency power and lighting"
emergency_power_lighting_exception undercuts improper_exhaust_interconnection

# manual: "or for emergency propulsion"
emergency_propulsion_exception undercuts improper_exhaust_interconnection

# manual: "Dampers or other suitable means must be installed to prevent backflow of boiler exhaust gases through the turbine."
backflow_protection_installed rebuts backflow_unprotected

# manual: "Interconnected exhausts must be specifically approved by the Commandant."
commandant_approval rebuts improper_exhaust_interconnection

# manual: "Automatic shutdown must occur under the following conditions:"
action keep_running idle

# manual: "Audible or visible alarms must also be provided for:"
action raise_alarm when any oil_pressure_alarm gas_temp_alarm oil_temp_alarm speed_alarm low_oil_pressure_alarm_only exhaust_in_classified_location air_inlet_classified_location_fault

# manual: "The control system must be designed for automatic shutdown of the engine with actuation of audible and visible alarms at shutdown."
action stop_turbine safe when any overspeed_fault low_oil_pressure_fault manual_shutdown

# manual: "The control system must be designed for automatic shutdown of the engine with actuation of audible and visible alarms at shutdown."
prefer stop_turbine over raise_alarm over keep_running
